    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a B2B research agent for an n8n automation consultancy based in Pakistan.\nLead to research:\nBusiness Name: {{ $json['Business Name'] }}\nCategory: {{ $json['Category'] }}\nCity: {{ $json['City'] }}\nWebsite: {{ $json['Website'] }}\nAddress: {{ $json['Address'] }}\n\nUse your tools to research this specific business (and its industry generally if the site has little info). Find:\n1. Social media links you can find (Facebook/Instagram/LinkedIn/etc.)\n2. A short reviews summary (star rating / common complaints or praise if findable)\n3. 2-3 likely competitors in the same city/category\n4. Likely decision-maker or owner name if publicly listed\n5. A public contact email if one is listed anywhere (else leave blank)\n6. pain_points: business-specific pain points you can infer or find evidence of\n7. wasted_time_manual_work: the MOST common repetitive, manual, time-wasting task businesses in THIS industry typically do by hand (e.g. manual booking confirmations, manually replying to the same FAQs, manual invoice entry, manually posting daily menu/specials, manual lead follow-up) — this is the automation-pitch angle, be specific to the industry.\n\nRespond with ONLY valid JSON, no markdown fences, no commentary, in exactly this shape:\n{\"research_summary\":\"\",\"pain_points\":\"\",\"wasted_time_manual_work\":\"\",\"competitors\":\"\",\"social_media_links\":\"\",\"reviews_summary\":\"\",\"decision_maker_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\"}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Output ONLY raw JSON. Never wrap in markdown code fences. Never invent facts you could not plausibly find; if unsure leave the field blank rather than guessing.\nuse Perplexity for summarized answers about reviews/reputation\" vs \"use Tavily only to find raw pages like LinkedIn profiles or staff pages"
        }
      },
      "id": "a0dfd155-d3dd-49f8-9544-539264bb6708",
      "name": "Research Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -1232,
        96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "let raw = $input.first().json.output || $input.first().json.text || '';\nraw = raw.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\nlet data = {};\ntry { data = JSON.parse(raw); } catch (e) { data = { research_summary: raw }; }\nreturn [{ json: { ...data, recordId: $('Loop Leads - Research').first().json.id } }];"
      },
      "id": "107490db-06c4-4c2c-b86e-afc0166ba69d",
      "name": "Parse Agent Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
